.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH sqop-extract-cert 1 "February 2025" "sqop 0.38.0" 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
sqop\-extract\-cert \- Extracts a Certificate from a Secret Key
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBsqop extract\-cert\fR [\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-armor\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Extracts a Certificate from a Secret Key
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Emit verbose output for debugging
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-armor\fR
Don\*(Aqt ASCII\-armor output
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
